# The PDA profile (report 038, phase S2: a portrait launcher, no writing zone) on the profile pda of the harness:
# 480x800 = the Pi 3A+ Waveshare 4.3" DSI turned to portrait (pi3a-wsdsi43-portrait: an 800x480 RGB565 buffer, rotate 90,
# 94x56 mm, 8.5 px/mm), 480x640 = a 3.5" 640x480 panel turned (71x53 mm, 9.0 px/mm). The home grid with the status
# strip at the Compact scale (230 px), a compat app in its 1x window over the toolbar, and the terminal with the fallback
# on-screen keyboard (no physical keyboard: the only text input of S2). Goldens at both sizes.
title pda home
sizes 480x640 480x800
profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_OSK auto
keyboards 0
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator "Mesh Hop=ip_panel_100.png" "RSS Reader=store_100.png" "Net Toolbox=ssh_100.png" "Serial Console=cli_100.png"
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
shot pda_home
header home
stockapp
shot pda_stockapp
home
launch CLI
ptyout "user@pda:~$ "
wait 300
shot pda_terminal_osk
